{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765674,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Bidstorm - IPL Auction","festival_id":521442,"organization_id":1076204,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-14T18:25:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/bidstorm-ipl-auction-nisadya-national-institute-of-technology-nit-tiruchirappalli-1765674","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>About the Event&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bidstorm is an IPL-style player auction where analytical skills meet real-time decision-making.<\/li>\n<li>From understanding player statistics and team combinations to smart bidding and tactical negotiations, the event simulates the intensity of a real IPL auction table. Teams have to think fast, bid smart, manage budgets effectively and outplay rival teams to build the ultimate squad.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Details<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mode: Offline&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Venue: Department of Management Studies, NIT Tiruchirappalli&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Participation: Team&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Team size: 3 members&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Event date: 13th and 14th November, 2026<\/li>\n<li>Registration Deadline: 17th October 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round Details&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Live Auction (single round, offline)&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Duration: 4 hours, conducted in real time across two days.<\/li>\n<li>Players are auctioned across multiple sets: batsmen, bowlers, all-rounders, wicketkeepers and&nbsp;<br \/>marquee players.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Teams bid, withdraw, and strategize dynamically based on budgets and squad requirements.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Evaluation and Feedback&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Duration: 10&ndash;15 minutes.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Teams are evaluated internally by the Organizing Committee against predefined auction rules&nbsp;<br \/>and performance criteria: &ndash; Squad balance and team composition &ndash; Budget utilization and bidding discipline &ndash; Strategic player selection &ndash; Overall auction performance&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all undergraduate and postgraduate students (engineering, management, arts, commerce, sciences, law, medical and others).<\/li>\n<li>Each team must consist of 3 members.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>All team members must be from the same college. Cross-college teams are not allowed.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>There is no limit on the number of teams from each college.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Students of NIT Tiruchirappalli (NITT) are not eligible. This event is strictly open to non-NITT participants only.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>General Rules&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;A participant can register as part of only one team for this event.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>&nbsp;Violation of the one-team rule will lead to disqualification of the entire team.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>All decisions, modifications and changes related to the event rest solely with the Organizing Committee, and their decision is final and binding.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards and Prizes&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participation certificate for all participants&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>The Third Place for an event will be awarded only if the number of participating teams is six or more for that event.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Prize: 1st place rs. 6000 and 2nd place rs. 3000<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":29663114,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-04T18:10:03+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-06T07:51:46+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"yEsFnp2","hashtags":null,"p